1
00:00:00,688 --> 00:00:03,228
(Penny:)Yeah, call it whatever you want,
I get minimum wage.

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:05,650
(Penny:)Yeah.

3
00:00:05,818 --> 00:00:07,738
(Penny:)I was wondering
if you could help me out...

4
00:00:07,904 --> 00:00:10,034
(Leonard:)- Yes.
- Oh.

5
00:00:10,198 --> 00:00:12,528
(Penny:)Okay, great, I'm having
some furniture delivered...

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,040
...and I may not be here, so, oh...

7
00:00:15,995 --> 00:00:17,325
(Penny:)Hello.

8
00:00:18,164 --> 00:00:20,244
[SPEAKS IN RUSSIAN]

9
00:00:21,626 --> 00:00:22,666
(Penny:)I'm sorry?

10
00:00:22,835 --> 00:00:26,175
(Howard:)Haven't you ever been told
how beautiful you are in flawless Russian?

11
00:00:26,339 --> 00:00:28,929
- No, I haven't.
- Get used to it.

12
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:31,179
(Penny:)Yeah, I probably won't.

13
00:00:32,261 --> 00:00:33,301
(Penny:)- Hey, Sheldon.
- Hi.

14
00:00:33,471 --> 00:00:35,181
(Penny:)Hey, Raj.

15
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:38,471
(Penny:)Still not talking to me, huh?

16
00:00:38,643 --> 00:00:40,683
(Sheldon:)Don't take it personally,
it's his pathology.

17
00:00:40,853 --> 00:00:43,643
(Sheldon:)- He can't talk to women.
- He can't talk to attractive women.

18
00:00:43,815 --> 00:00:46,315
(Howard:)Or in your case,
a cheesecake-scented goddess.

19
00:00:46,776 --> 00:00:49,446
(Leonard:)- There's gonna be some furniture delivered?
- Yeah.

20
00:00:49,612 --> 00:00:53,202
(Penny:)If it gets here and I'm not here,
could you sign for it and put it in?

21
00:00:53,366 --> 00:00:55,696
(Leonard:)- Yeah, no problem.
- Great, here's my spare key.

22
00:00:55,868 --> 00:00:58,018
(Penny:)Thank you.

